Description: @BOOTMGR_ANDROID_DISTRIBUTION_NAME@ for @TARGET_DEVICE@
 Installs the Android system next to this Linux distribution, on the
 same filesystem, and adds it to the GRUB menu. Android keeps its user
 data in @ANDROID_DIR@.
 .
 The filesystem must be ext4 or F2FS, directly on a partition or disk
 (not on LVM or LUKS).
